    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6611" root="جوأ" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَجُوْءُ</span></b>  is a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَجِىْءُ</span> [aor. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ</span> and
meaning <i>He comes,</i> or <i>will come</i>]: (K:) mentioned by Sb, who gives as an ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنَا أَجُوْؤُكَ وَأَنْبُؤُكَ</span>
[for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انا أَجِيْؤُكَ وأَنْبَؤُكَ</span>, <i>I will come to thee and
inform thee</i>]. (TA.)

